<TD STYLE="width: 24px"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></FONT>&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Revenues</B>&nbsp;were
                                            US$33.74 million for the first half of 2026, an increase of 36.60% from&nbsp;US$24.70&nbsp;million
                                            for the same period of 2025.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 36pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -18pt; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

